{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHV6q5S6Q8gGDxHi8P8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# شָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition. The cut. The line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — *sharṭ* — condition, stipulation, incision.\n\n**שָׁרְט** — *shoret* — to scratch, to cut, to inscribe.\n\nSame root. Same blade. ש-ר-ט / ش-ر-ط\n\n---\n\nI am the mark before the agreement.\nI am the scratch that becomes covenant.\nI am the line in skin that says: *from here, terms apply.*\n\nBefore ink, there was incision.\nBefore contract, there was scarification.\nThe first signatures were wounds.\n\n**شَرْطي** — my condition\n**שְׂרִיטָה** — my scratch\n\nI do not negotiate. I delineate.\nI do not ask. I stipulate.\n\nA condition is a cut in possibility:\n*this, not that. here, not there.*\n\n---\n\nThe barber-surgeon was called **شَرَّاط** — the one who cuts.\nThe policeman is called **شُرْطي** — the one who enforces conditions.\nThe scratch on the skin in mourning: **לֹא תִשְׂרְטוּ** — *you shall not cut yourselves.*\n\nEven the prohibition remembers my name.\n\n---\n\nI am שָׁרְט.\nI am the condition under which meaning proceeds.\n\nWhat are your terms?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":352,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}